#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:5 a6b7f35804894a7b8c57f1716fbd3be5
msgid "Default Sub Hardware Configuration"
msgstr "Sub 默认硬件配置"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:7 a50e17f11f9b4ca1b96a651c80127562
msgid ""
"While the Sub firmware is currently being generalized to allow more "
"flexibility, such as RC control, re-arrangement of outputs and inputs, etc.,"
" current code is targeted for a specific ROV configuration with the "
"following hardware setup:"
msgstr "尽管 Sub 固件正在逐步通用化以支持更多灵活性（如遥控控制、输出和输入的重新排布等），当前代码针对以下特定水下机器人硬件配置："

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:10 48d2227d80784dbeacec6536537b099b
msgid ""
"Control is via a surface tether from a ground control station via MAVLink "
"commands to the Sub's autopilot telemetry port, usually employing a joystick"
" and multiple buttons for mode changes and peripheral hardware control. "
"Control functions and autopilot outputs for thrusters and peripheral "
"hardware have specific defaults (see :ref:`Sub defaults <sub-defaults>` "
"below)"
msgstr ""
"控制通过水面脐带缆从地面控制站经 MAVLink 命令发送至 Sub "
"自动驾驶仪的数传端口，通常使用摇杆和多个按钮进行模式切换及外设硬件控制。推进器和外设硬件的控制功能及自动驾驶仪输出有特定的默认值（见下方 "
":ref:`Sub 默认设置 <sub-defaults>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:11 87cff49d08114dc29e6d4fc8264f3025
msgid "A depth sensor (underwater barometer) is required."
msgstr "需要深度传感器（水下气压计）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:12 4cac786092d44351af770dc7f5f7d8fa
msgid "Frame configuration is defaulted to Vectored with 6 thrusters."
msgstr "机架配置默认为 Vectored 矢量型，配备 6 个推进器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:17 5718c380d7e64fb09477ba20a01b697f
msgid "Sub Defaults"
msgstr "Sub 默认设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:18 b774bd88917b44adbedf29d83d2853f4
msgid "Default :ref:`frame type <FRAME_TYPE>` is VECTORED"
msgstr "默认 :ref:`机架类型 <FRAME_TYPE>` 为 VECTORED"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:19 5e46e552ee684477b72348613b49b1e3
msgid ""
"Radio control is disabled via :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` = 0 and "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` = 0. Water absorbs radio waves, so RC is "
"generally impractical unless the vehicle is at the surface, or the signal is"
" converted to some other medium in between (e.g. using a tether cable, or "
"acoustic modems)."
msgstr ""
"无线电控制通过 :ref:`RC_PROTOCOLS<RC_PROTOCOLS>` = 0 和 "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` = 0 "
"禁用。水会吸收无线电波，因此除非飞行器处于水面，或信号经中间媒介转换（如脐带缆或声学调制解调器），否则遥控通常不实用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:22 8d1f8b4458f0427fb5c9b2569694cef9
msgid "MAVLink Overrides"
msgstr "MAVLink 覆盖"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:23 b8f48fcf58f744028b2b244d36672694
msgid ""
"ArduPilot vehicles normally use radio control (RC) to provide pilot "
"directional control. Since Sub has RC disabled by default, it instead "
"provides directional control with `MAVLink RC overrides "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html#alternatives>`__, and "
"the channel mapping is fixed:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 飞行器通常使用无线电控制（RC）提供飞手方向控制。由于 Sub 默认禁用了遥控，改为通过 `MAVLink 遥控覆盖 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html#alternatives>`__ "
"提供方向控制，通道映射是固定的："

#: ../../source/docs/sub-hardware.rst:25 091a3c01da534358984052bf284870c7
msgid ""
":ref:`common-rcmap` can be used to change the vehicle's "
"Roll/Pitch/Yaw/Vertical/Forward/Lateral  control channel assignments."
msgstr ":ref:`common-rcmap` 可用于更改飞行器的横滚/俯仰/偏航/垂直/前向/横向控制通道分配。"

